  "headline": "FDA's records show the amino acid injection shortage has been listed since 2020-12-08 with no public FDA signal at our plants",
  "headline_cites": ["E6", "E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows the amino acid injection from B. Braun Medical Inc. has been in Current status since its initial posting on 2020-12-08.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 70 months.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label cb6d23ff identifies B. Braun Medical Inc. as the labeler with manufacturing operations at the B BRAUN plant.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our three Corvale sites all source this product from B. Braun Medical Inc. under NDC 00264193310.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has only 2.5 days of supply on hand at a daily use of 4.1 units.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 25.9 days of supply and can spare 13 units while retaining two weeks of inventory.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 13 units from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 6 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
